<title>POLAND: Poland clears Credis, PKO BP mutual fund.</title>
<headline>Poland clears Credis, PKO BP mutual fund.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) has approved for operation the Credis/PKO BP Polsko- Szwajcarskie Towarzystwo Funduszy Powierniczych mutual fund company and its operating of a balanced fund, the KPW said.</p>
<p>The KPW's Thursday statement gave no other details.</p>
<p>State-owned  PKO BP is Poland's largest retail bank.</p>
<p>(( -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700  ))</p>
</text>
